{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #178", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>If 5a-3b&radic;3 =25 +12&radic;3, then what is the value of a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup>?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 5a-3b&radic;3 =25 +12&radic;3, &#2340;&#2379; a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["109", "108", "112", "107"], "options_hi": ["109", "108", "112", "107"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>As per given 5a-3b&radic;3 =25 +12&radic;3</p><p>Comparing LHS and RHS</p><p>a = 5 and b =-4</p><p>a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup> =125  -  (16) = 109</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>As per given 5a-3b&radic;3 =25 +12&radic;3</p><p>Comparing LHS and RHS</p><p>a = 5 and b =-4</p><p>a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup> =125  -  (16) = 109</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If <img width=118 height=46 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12777/image004.png\">, then which of the following is TRUE?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <img width=118 height=46 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12777/image004.png\">, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Both 'a' and 'b' are factions.", "Both 'a' and 'b' are integers.", "'a' is a fraction while 'b' is an integer.", "'a' is an integer while 'b' is a fraction."], "options_hi": ["'a' &#2324;&#2352; 'b' &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2327;&#2369;&#2335; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;", "'a' &#2324;&#2352; 'b' &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;", "'a' &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; 'b' &#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;", "'a' &#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; 'b' &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=538 height=260 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12777/image005.png\"></p><p>After comparing:</p><p>a = 3 and b = 4/3</p><p>Hence, 'a' is an integer while 'b' is a fraction.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=538 height=260 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12777/image005.png\"></p><p>After comparing:</p><p>a = 3 and b = 4/3</p><p>Hence, 'a' is an integer while 'b' is a fraction.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>&radic;675  -  &radic;243 + &radic;588  -  &radic;1452 = a&radic;3, then what is the value of a<sup>3</sup>  -  4a<sup>2</sup>  -  2a + 7?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&radic;675 - &radic;243 + &radic;588 - &radic;1452 = a&radic;3, &#2340;&#2379; a<sup>3</sup> - 4a<sup>2</sup> - 2a + 7 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["-11", "-9", "-13", "-15"], "options_hi": ["-11", "-9", "-13", "-15"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>&radic;675  -  &radic;243 + &radic;588  -  &radic;1452 = a&radic;3</p><p>&radic;(15 * 15 * 3)  -  &radic;(9 * 9 * 3) + &radic;(14 * 14 * 3)  -  &radic;(22 * 22 * 3) = a&radic;3</p><p>15&radic;3  -  9&radic;3 + 14&radic;3  -  22&radic;3 = a&radic;3</p><p>29&radic;3  -  31&radic;3 = a&radic;3</p><p>-2&radic;3 = a&radic;3</p><p>a = -2</p><p>Therefore, a<sup>3</sup>  -  4a<sup>2</sup>  -  2a + 7</p><p>= (-2)<sup>3</sup>  -  4(-2)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(-2) + 7</p><p>= -8  -  16 + 4 + 7</p><p>= -24 + 11</p><p>= <b>-13</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&radic;675  -  &radic;243 + &radic;588  -  &radic;1452 = a&radic;3</p><p>&radic;(15 * 15 * 3)  -  &radic;(9 * 9 * 3) + &radic;(14 * 14 * 3)  -  &radic;(22 * 22 * 3) = a&radic;3</p><p>15&radic;3  -  9&radic;3 + 14&radic;3  -  22&radic;3 = a&radic;3</p><p>29&radic;3  -  31&radic;3 = a&radic;3</p><p>-2&radic;3 = a&radic;3</p><p>a = -2</p><p>Therefore, a<sup>3</sup>  -  4a<sup>2</sup>  -  2a + 7</p><p>= (-2)<sup>3</sup>  -  4(-2)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(-2) + 7</p><p>= -8  -  16 + 4 + 7</p><p>= -24 + 11</p><p>= <b>-13</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If (1  -  &radic;5)<sup>2</sup>(2  -  &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> + (3 + &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5, then find the value of 'b'.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (1 - &radic;5)<sup>2</sup>(2 - &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> + (3 + &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b) + (a - b)&radic;5, &#2340;&#2379; 'b' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["46", "38", "62", "56"], "options_hi": ["46", "38", "62", "56"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>(1  -  &radic;5)<sup>2</sup>(2  -  &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> + (3 + &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>(1 + 5  -  2&radic;5)(4 + 5  -  2&radic;5) + 9 + 5 + 6&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>(6  -  2&radic;5)(9  -  2&radic;5) + 14 + 6&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>54  -  12&radic;5  -  18&radic;5 + 20 + 14 + 6&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>88  -  24&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>Now, a + b = 88 =&gt; a = 88  -  b</p><p>a  -  b = -24 =&gt; a = b  -  24</p><p>Then, 88  -  b = b  -  24</p><p>2b = 112</p><p><b>b = 56</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(1  -  &radic;5)<sup>2</sup>(2  -  &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> + (3 + &radic;5)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>(1 + 5  -  2&radic;5)(4 + 5  -  2&radic;5) + 9 + 5 + 6&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>(6  -  2&radic;5)(9  -  2&radic;5) + 14 + 6&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>54  -  12&radic;5  -  18&radic;5 + 20 + 14 + 6&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>88  -  24&radic;5 = (a + b) + (a  -  b)&radic;5</p><p>Now, a + b = 88 =&gt; a = 88  -  b</p><p>a  -  b = -24 =&gt; a = b  -  24</p><p>Then, 88  -  b = b  -  24</p><p>2b = 112</p><p><b>b = 56</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If (&radic;2 + 3)/(&radic;2  -  3)  -  (&radic;2  -  3)/(&radic;2 + 3) = m + n&radic;2, then what is the value of (m  -  n)? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (&radic;2 + 3)/(&radic;2 - 3) - (&radic;2 - 3)/(&radic;2 + 3) = m + n&radic;2, &#2340;&#2379; (m - n) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["12", "15/8", "12/7", "11&radic;3"], "options_hi": ["12", "15/8", "12/7", "11&radic;3"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(&radic;2 + 3)/(&radic;2  -  3)  -  (&radic;2  -  3)/(&radic;2 + 3) = m + n&radic;2</p><p>[(&radic;2 + 3)<sup>2</sup>  -  (&radic;2  -  3)<sup>2</sup>]/(&radic;2 + 3)(&radic;2  -  3) = m + n&radic;2</p><p>12&radic;2/(-7) = m + n&radic;2</p><p>Comparing both sides  -  </p><p>m = 0 and n = -12/7</p><p>m  -  n = 0  -  (-12/7) = 12/7</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(&radic;2 + 3)/(&radic;2  -  3)  -  (&radic;2  -  3)/(&radic;2 + 3) = m + n&radic;2</p><p>[(&radic;2 + 3)<sup>2</sup>  -  (&radic;2  -  3)<sup>2</sup>]/(&radic;2 + 3)(&radic;2  -  3) = m + n&radic;2</p><p>12&radic;2/(-7) = m + n&radic;2</p><p>Comparing both sides  -  </p><p>m = 0 and n = -12/7</p><p>m  -  n = 0  -  (-12/7) = 12/7</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What value should come in place of the question mark?</p><p>(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> &div; (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> &div; (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p>", "options_en": ["84", "63", "94", "89"], "options_hi": ["84", "63", "94", "89"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> &div; (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>[(2)<sup>6</sup>]<sup>8 </sup>* 1/(4)<sup>32 </sup>* (2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>18</sup> * (2)<sup>44</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>[(2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>18</sup> * (2)<sup>44</sup>)/(2)<sup>64</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>(2)<sup>48 + 48 + 18 + 44  -  64 </sup>= (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>? = 48 + 48 + 18 + 44  -  64 = 94</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> &div; (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>[(2)<sup>6</sup>]<sup>8 </sup>* 1/(4)<sup>32 </sup>* (2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>18</sup> * (2)<sup>44</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>[(2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>18</sup> * (2)<sup>44</sup>)/(2)<sup>64</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>(2)<sup>48 + 48 + 18 + 44  -  64 </sup>= (2)<sup>?</sup></p><p>? = 48 + 48 + 18 + 44  -  64 = 94</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Let a = (&radic;3 + 1) / (&radic;3 - 1). Simplify a + 1/a.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2354;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; a = (&radic;3 + 1) / (&radic;3 - 1)&#2404; a + 1/a &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["2", "4", "6", "8"], "options_hi": ["2", "4", "6", "8"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>&#183; First, rationalize a:</p><p>a = [(&radic;3 + 1)/(&radic;3 - 1)]  X  [(&radic;3 + 1)/(&radic;3 + 1)]</p><p>= ( (&radic;3 + 1)&#178; ) / (3 - 1)</p><p>= (3 + 2&radic;3 + 1) / 2</p><p>= (4 + 2&radic;3) / 2</p><p>= 2 + &radic;3.</p><p>&#183; Then 1/a = 1 / (2 + &radic;3). Rationalize again:</p><p>1 / (2 + &radic;3)  X  [(2 - &radic;3)/(2 - &radic;3)] = (2 - &radic;3) / (4 - 3) = 2 - &radic;3.</p><p>&#183; So a + 1/a = (2 + &radic;3) + (2 - &radic;3) = 4.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&#183; First, rationalize a:</p><p>a = [(&radic;3 + 1)/(&radic;3 - 1)]  X  [(&radic;3 + 1)/(&radic;3 + 1)]</p><p>= ( (&radic;3 + 1)&#178; ) / (3 - 1)</p><p>= (3 + 2&radic;3 + 1) / 2</p><p>= (4 + 2&radic;3) / 2</p><p>= 2 + &radic;3.</p><p>&#183; Then 1/a = 1 / (2 + &radic;3). Rationalize again:</p><p>1 / (2 + &radic;3)  X  [(2 - &radic;3)/(2 - &radic;3)] = (2 - &radic;3) / (4 - 3) = 2 - &radic;3.</p><p>&#183; So a + 1/a = (2 + &radic;3) + (2 - &radic;3) = 4.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p> If x = 3 - &radic;2, then find the value of 3x <sup>2</sup> + 2x &#8211; 4 </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = 3 - &radic;2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 3x <sup>2</sup> + 2x - 4 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["20 - &radic;2", "35 + &radic;2", "35 - 20&radic;2", "35 - 2&radic;2"], "options_hi": ["20 - &radic;2", "35 + &radic;2", "35 - 20&radic;2", "35 - 2&radic;2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "\"<p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/241700a4368e621ac498b9a241794937.png\" /> </p>\"", "solution_hi": "\"<p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/241700a4368e621ac498b9a241794937.png\" /> </p>\"", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of m + 2n?</p><p><img width=168 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image003.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>m + 2n &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p><img width=\"168\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image003.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["6", "2", "0", "4"], "options_hi": ["6", "2", "0", "4"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=212 height=172 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image004.png\"></p><p>On comparing both the sides, we get</p><p>12 + 2m = -12</p><p>2m = -24</p><p>m = -12</p><p>And -12 = 12  -  3n</p><p>-24 = -3n</p><p>n = 8</p><p>Therefore, m + 2n = -12 + 2 * 8 = -12 + 16 =<b> 4</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=212 height=172 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image004.png\"></p><p>On comparing both the sides, we get</p><p>12 + 2m = -12</p><p>2m = -24</p><p>m = -12</p><p>And -12 = 12  -  3n</p><p>-24 = -3n</p><p>n = 8</p><p>Therefore, m + 2n = -12 + 2 * 8 = -12 + 16 =<b> 4</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of 'n' in the expression given below.</p><p><img width=134 height=43 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image005.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 'n' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"134\" height=\"43\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image005.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["63", "49", "54", "71"], "options_hi": ["63", "49", "54", "71"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=173 height=201 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image006.png\"></p><p>n + 25 = 2n  -  38</p><p>2n  -  n = 25 + 38</p><p><b>n = 63</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=173 height=201 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image006.png\"></p><p>n + 25 = 2n  -  38</p><p>2n  -  n = 25 + 38</p><p><b>n = 63</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following option is correct?</p><p><img width=213 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image025.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p><img width=\"213\" height=\"23\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p12361/image025.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["R &lt; Q", "R &gt; Q", "Q &gt; R &lt; P", "R &lt; P"], "options_hi": ["R &lt; Q", "R &gt; Q", "Q &gt; R &lt; P", "R &lt; P"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Here, P = (1290)<sup>1/20</sup>, Q = (930)<sup>1/10</sup>, R = (40)<sup>1/5</sup></p><p>By taking LCM of powers, we get</p><p>P<sup>20</sup> = (1290)<sup>20/20</sup>, Q<sup>20</sup> = (930)<sup>20/10</sup>, R<sup>20</sup> = (40)<sup>20/5</sup></p><p>P<sup>20</sup> = 1290, Q<sup>20</sup> = (930)<sup>2</sup>, R<sup>20</sup> = 40<sup>4</sup></p><p>This means R<sup>20</sup> &gt; Q<sup>20</sup> &gt; P<sup>20</sup>.</p><p>Then R &gt; Q &gt; P.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, P = (1290)<sup>1/20</sup>, Q = (930)<sup>1/10</sup>, R = (40)<sup>1/5</sup></p><p>By taking LCM of powers, we get</p><p>P<sup>20</sup> = (1290)<sup>20/20</sup>, Q<sup>20</sup> = (930)<sup>20/10</sup>, R<sup>20</sup> = (40)<sup>20/5</sup></p><p>P<sup>20</sup> = 1290, Q<sup>20</sup> = (930)<sup>2</sup>, R<sup>20</sup> = 40<sup>4</sup></p><p>This means R<sup>20</sup> &gt; Q<sup>20</sup> &gt; P<sup>20</sup>.</p><p>Then R &gt; Q &gt; P.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If &radic;(5 * p) * &radic;5 = &radic;1584  -  &radic;396  -  &radic;275 + &radic;176, then what is the value of 'p'?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &radic;(5 * p) * &radic;5 = &radic;1584 - &radic;396 - &radic;275 + &radic;176, &#2340;&#2379; 'p' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; ?</p>", "options_en": ["7", "11", "13", "17"], "options_hi": ["7", "11", "13", "17"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>=> &radic;(5 * p) * &radic;5 = &radic;1584  -  &radic;396  -  &radic;275 + &radic;176</p><p>=> (&radic;5 * &radic;5) * &radic;p = &radic;(144 * 11)  -  &radic;(36 * 11)  -  &radic;(25 * 11) + &radic;(16 * 11)</p><p>=> 5&radic;p = 12&radic;11  -  6&radic;11  -  5&radic;11 + 4&radic;11</p><p>=> 5&radic;p = 5&radic;11</p><p>=> p = 11</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>=> &radic;(5 * p) * &radic;5 = &radic;1584  -  &radic;396  -  &radic;275 + &radic;176</p><p>=> (&radic;5 * &radic;5) * &radic;p = &radic;(144 * 11)  -  &radic;(36 * 11)  -  &radic;(25 * 11) + &radic;(16 * 11)</p><p>=> 5&radic;p = 12&radic;11  -  6&radic;11  -  5&radic;11 + 4&radic;11</p><p>=> 5&radic;p = 5&radic;11</p><p>=> p = 11</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>&radic;(9 - 2&radic;14) - &radic;(15 - 4&radic;14) is equal to:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&radic;(9 - 2&radic;14) - &radic;(15 - 4&radic;14) &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["2&radic;7 - 3&radic;2", "2&radic;7 - &radic;2", "&radic;2/3", "3&radic;2"], "options_hi": ["2&radic;7 - 3&radic;2", "2&radic;7 - &radic;2", "&radic;2/3", "3&radic;2"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=167 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-001.png\"></p><p><img width=250 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-002.png\"></p><p><img width=439 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-003.png\"></p><p><img width=209 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-004.png\"></p><p><img width=147 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-005.png\"></p><p><img width=84 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-006.png\"></p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=167 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-001.png\"></p><p><img width=250 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-002.png\"></p><p><img width=439 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-003.png\"></p><p><img width=209 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-004.png\"></p><p><img width=147 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-005.png\"></p><p><img width=84 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230102t2npm2401-006.png\"></p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If a = 2 + 3&radic;2 and b = 3  -  2&radic;2, then what is the value of (a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>)/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a = 2 + 3&radic;2 &#2324;&#2352; b = 3 - 2&radic;2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup>)/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["3&radic;2 + 2", "7&radic;2  -  4", "5&radic;2  -  1", "9&radic;2 + 6"], "options_hi": ["3&radic;2 + 2", "7&radic;2 - 4", "5&radic;2 - 1", "9&radic;2 + 6"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We know, (a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>) = (a  -  b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Then, (a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>)/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (a  -  b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= a  -  b</p><p>= 2 + 3&radic;2  -  3 + 2&radic;2</p><p><b>= 5&radic;2  -  1</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know, (a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>) = (a  -  b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Then, (a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>)/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (a  -  b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= a  -  b</p><p>= 2 + 3&radic;2  -  3 + 2&radic;2</p><p><b>= 5&radic;2  -  1</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the following: 11 + &radic;48 + &radic;72 + &radic;24</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; : 11 + &radic;48 + &radic;72 + &radic;24</p>", "options_en": ["(&radic;2 + &radic;6 + &radic;5)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;5 + &radic;2 + &radic;7)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;5 + &radic;6 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;6 + &radic;2 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup>"], "options_hi": ["(&radic;2 + &radic;6 + &radic;5)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;5 + &radic;2 + &radic;7)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;5 + &radic;6 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;6 + &radic;2 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup>"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>We know, (a + b + c)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2 </sup>+ c<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + 2bc + 2ac</p><p>Here, 11 + &radic;48 + &radic;72 + &radic;24</p><p>= (&radic;6)<sup>2</sup> + (&radic;2)<sup>2 </sup>+ (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup> + 2 (&radic;6&radic;2 + &radic;6&radic;3 + &radic;3&radic;2)</p><p>= <b>(&radic;6 + &radic;2 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup></b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know, (a + b + c)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2 </sup>+ c<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + 2bc + 2ac</p><p>Here, 11 + &radic;48 + &radic;72 + &radic;24</p><p>= (&radic;6)<sup>2</sup> + (&radic;2)<sup>2 </sup>+ (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup> + 2 (&radic;6&radic;2 + &radic;6&radic;3 + &radic;3&radic;2)</p><p>= <b>(&radic;6 + &radic;2 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup></b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of &radic;(20 - &radic;(20 - &radic;(20 - .......</p>", "q_hi": "<p><img width=\"225\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p11154/image005.png\"> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["4", "5", "3", "6"], "options_hi": ["4", "5", "3", "6"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let</p><p>X = &radic;(20 - &radic;(20 - &radic;(20 - ....</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> = (20  -  X)</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + X  -  20 = 0</p><p>X = 4, -5</p><p>But X is non-negative</p><p>Thus, X = 4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let</p><p>X = &radic;(20 - &radic;(20 - &radic;(20 - ....</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> = (20  -  X)</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + X  -  20 = 0</p><p>X = 4, -5</p><p>But X is non-negative</p><p>Thus, X = 4</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following is irrational?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350;&#2375;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Product of (3 - &radic;27) and (&radic;9 + 3&radic;3)", "Sum of (5 - 4&radic;2) and 4(6 + &radic;2)", "Sum of &radic;4761 and &radic;5175", "Product of &radic;16875 and &radic;27"], "options_hi": ["(3 - &radic;27) &#2324;&#2352; (&radic;9 + 3&radic;3) &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2347;&#2354;", "(5 - 4&radic;2) &#2324;&#2352; 4(6 + &radic;2) &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;", "&radic;4761 &#2324;&#2352; &radic;5175 &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;", "&radic;16875 &#2324;&#2352; &radic;27 &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2347;&#2354;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Option (1):</p><p>= Product of (3 - &radic;27) and (&radic;9 + 3&radic;3)</p><p>= (3 - 3&radic;3)(3 + 3&radic;3)</p><p>= - 18 (which is not irrational)</p><p>Option (2):</p><p>= Sum of (5 - 4&radic;2) and 4(6 + &radic;2)</p><p>= (5 - 4&radic;2) + 4(6 + &radic;2)</p><p>= 5 - 4&radic;2 + 24 + 4&radic;2</p><p>= 29 (which is not irrational)</p><p>Option (3):</p><p>= Sum of &radic;4761 and &radic;5175</p><p>= 69 + 15&radic;23 (which is irrational)</p><p>Option (4):</p><p>= Product of &radic;16875 and &radic;27</p><p>= 75&radic;3 x 3&radic;3</p><p>= 675 (which is not irrational)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Option (1):</p><p>= Product of (3 - &radic;27) and (&radic;9 + 3&radic;3)</p><p>= (3 - 3&radic;3)(3 + 3&radic;3)</p><p>= - 18 (which is not irrational)</p><p>Option (2):</p><p>= Sum of (5 - 4&radic;2) and 4(6 + &radic;2)</p><p>= (5 - 4&radic;2) + 4(6 + &radic;2)</p><p>= 5 - 4&radic;2 + 24 + 4&radic;2</p><p>= 29 (which is not irrational)</p><p>Option (3):</p><p>= Sum of &radic;4761 and &radic;5175</p><p>= 69 + 15&radic;23 (which is irrational)</p><p>Option (4):</p><p>= Product of &radic;16875 and &radic;27</p><p>= 75&radic;3 x 3&radic;3</p><p>= 675 (which is not irrational)</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the following: 9 + 6&radic;2</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;: 9 + 6&radic;2</p>", "options_en": ["(2&radic;3 + &radic;6)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;3 + 2&radic;2)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;6 + &radic;2)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;3 + &radic;6)<sup>2</sup>"], "options_hi": ["(2&radic;3 + &radic;6)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;3 + 2&radic;2)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;6 + &radic;2)<sup>2</sup>", "(&radic;3 + &radic;6)<sup>2</sup>"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>We know, (a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2 </sup>+ 2ab</p><p>Then, 9 + 6&radic;2</p><p>= 3 + 6 + 2 * 3 * &radic;2</p><p>= (&radic;3)<sup>2 </sup>+ (&radic;6)<sup>2</sup> + 2 * &radic;3 * &radic;6</p><p>= <b>(&radic;3 + &radic;6)<sup>2</sup></b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know, (a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2 </sup>+ 2ab</p><p>Then, 9 + 6&radic;2</p><p>= 3 + 6 + 2 * 3 * &radic;2</p><p>= (&radic;3)<sup>2 </sup>+ (&radic;6)<sup>2</sup> + 2 * &radic;3 * &radic;6</p><p>= <b>(&radic;3 + &radic;6)<sup>2</sup></b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If a =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2 + &radic;3", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2 + &radic;3", "options_en": ["185", "195", "200", "175"], "options_hi": ["185", "195", "200", "175"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>\"</p><p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/SSCT-MML-003589.png\"/> </p><p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/SSCT-MML-006386.png\"/><br></p><p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/SSCT-MML-006393.png\"/> \"</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>\"</p><p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/SSCT-MML-003589.png\"/> </p><p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/SSCT-MML-006386.png\"/><br></p><p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/SSCT-MML-006393.png\"/> \"</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If x = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'><span style='font-size: 19px;'>&radic;", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'><span style='font-size: 19px;'>&radic;", "options_en": ["350", "345", "284", "322"], "options_hi": ["350", "345", "284", "322"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=227 height=43 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20788/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=231 height=43 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20788/image017.png\"></p><p>So, <img width=167 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20788/image018.png\"></p><p>=&gt; x + 1/x = 18</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> + 2 = 324</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>-2</sup> = 322</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=227 height=43 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20788/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=231 height=43 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20788/image017.png\"></p><p>So, <img width=167 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20788/image018.png\"></p><p>=&gt; x + 1/x = 18</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> + 2 = 324</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>-2</sup> = 322</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}